c’ to do it. ‎", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:32:34Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Any guesses?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:33:46Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "The only president in living memory post the ascendancy of the regime in tehran who was somewhat dovish on iran was obama. And even he used the threat of complete annihilation to get the ayatollahs to negotiate.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:34:46Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "And Obama is probably the most israel skeptic president in the past 40 yrs. Even he doubled US aid to israel. America works with Israel because it sees substantial geopolitical interest in doing so. Nothing more nothing less.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:37:35Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "You posit opinions as facts", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:37:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Obama upping aid to israel isnt an opinion.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:38:01Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "It happened", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:38:16Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Do you think that’s the part I’m calling an opinion?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:38:23Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Then I’ll shut up", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-04T06:38:47Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "As did the fact that by the end he was so pissed with them, just before he left office